{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28291","headline":"题永崇西平王宅太尉愬院六韵 · 杜牧","name":"题永崇西平王宅太尉愬院六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天下无双将，关西第一雄。\n授符黄石老，学劒白猿翁。\n矫矫云长勇，恂恂郄縠风。\n家呼小太尉，国号大梁公。\n半夜龙骧去，中原虎穴空。\n陇山兵十万，嗣子握琱弓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}